Package: oo7z
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: 7-Zip multi-format container unpacker and lister with AES-256 encryption
 A sovereign 7-Zip container unpacker and lister written in pure openOODA, featuring
 zero ambient authority, path-traversal resistant safe extraction, themed table formatting
 via oote palettes, and a Model Context Protocol (MCP) stdio server.
